      "updated_at": "2017-06-10T16:02:08Z",
      "body": "@mdipierro I think if you're assuming administrators can copy secrets, then it's easy for administrators to keep a copy of which vote corresponds to which voter, too. I prefer a solution that keeps the link between voter and encrypted vote public, as that has many security/logging/auditing benefits, and then works the security around that :)",
